    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ioann/ontologies/2025/6/ClassicalGuitarTeachingMethodOntology/supplements/swrl">
        <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ioann/ontologies/2025/6/ClassicalGuitarTeachingMethodOntology/supplements/swrl/1.0.0"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ioann/ontologies/2025/6/ClassicalGuitarTeachingMethodOntology/1.6.0"/>
        <dc:creator xml:lang="en">Ioannis Kakaras</dc:creator>
        <dc:creator xml:lang="el">Ιωάννης Κακάρας</dc:creator>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A separate SWRL rule layer for deriving pedagogical inferences from ClassicalGuitarOntology v1.6.0 without modifying the validated core ontology.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="el">Χωριστό επίπεδο κανόνων SWRL για την παραγωγή παιδαγωγικών συμπερασμάτων από την ClassicalGuitarOntology v1.6.0, χωρίς τροποποίηση της επικυρωμένης βασικής οντολογίας.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ClassicalGuitarOntology SWRL Supplement</rdfs:label>
        <owl:versionInfo xml:lang="en">v1.0.0 · 28 August 2026. Final Phase 2 SWRL supplement containing the validated R01_SameLevelSkillAlignment and R02_ObjectiveSkillFromTeachingPractice rules. Both rules passed independent isolated validation, including positive and control tests, OWL-only/HermiT checks, post-materialization HermiT verification, and adversarial inference review. Combined R01+R02 integration validation also passed, including exact chaining completeness, traceability, semantic review, fresh-process Drools execution, temporary Drools-to-OWL materialization, and post-materialization HermiT verification. No additional SWRL rules are included. The frozen ClassicalGuitarOntology v1.6.0 baseline remains unmodified.</owl:versionInfo>
        <owl:versionInfo xml:lang="el">v1.0.0 · 28 Αυγούστου 2026. Τελικό συμπλήρωμα SWRL της Phase 2 που περιλαμβάνει τους επικυρωμένους κανόνες R01_SameLevelSkillAlignment και R02_ObjectiveSkillFromTeachingPractice. Και οι δύο κανόνες πέρασαν ανεξάρτητη isolated επικύρωση, συμπεριλαμβανομένων positive και control tests, OWL-only/HermiT ελέγχων, post-materialization HermiT verification και adversarial inference review. Η συνδυασμένη επικύρωση R01+R02 ολοκληρώθηκε επίσης επιτυχώς, συμπεριλαμβανομένων exact chaining completeness, traceability, semantic review, fresh-process Drools execution, προσωρινού Drools-to-OWL materialization και post-materialization HermiT verification. Δεν περιλαμβάνονται πρόσθετοι SWRL rules. Η frozen ClassicalGuitarOntology v1.6.0 baseline παραμένει αμετάβλητη.</owl:versionInfo>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="el">Συμπλήρωμα κανόνων SWRL της ClassicalGuitarOntology</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


